          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-950 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
          >
            <Mail class="w-6 h-6 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400" />
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">
            Found something we missed?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Security reports, architecture questions and requests for source
