          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
            <a
              href="mailto:security@summitnotes.app"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-sky-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-600 transition-colors"
            >
              security@summitnotes.app
            </a>
            <a
              href="/security"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border font-semibold rounded-lg text-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors"
            >
              Security overview
            </a>
            <a
